{"sections":[{"slug":"Segre嵌入","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Segre嵌入"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Segre <span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Segre 嵌入"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E_1,\\cdots,E_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n<span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $P = P(E_1) \\times_X\\cdots\\times_X P(E_n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的纤维积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的线丛</span>\n$$\r\nL = \\mathrm{pr}_1^* \\mathcal O(1)\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\mathrm{pr}_n^*\\mathcal O(1),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">带上</span>\n$$\r\n(P\\to X)^* (E_1\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X}\\cdots\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X} E_n) \\twoheadrightarrow L\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">对应的映射</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对射影谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对射影谱</span>"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nP(E_1) \\times_X\\cdots\\times_X P(E_n) \\to P(E_1\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X}\\cdots\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X} E_n).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong>Segre <span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是一个闭嵌入</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}